 "remarks": "NEWLY REDUCED - RESERVED PARKING SPOT AND LAUNDRY IN THE COMPLEX! HEAT, HOT WATER INCLUDED! Bright, sunny, and spacious renovated condo unit. Hard wood floors throughout. Nicely renovated kitchen, tile floor, cherry cabinets, updated appliances, recessed lighting, 1 Ceiling fan. Fresh full bathroom with stall shower, ceramic tile. Generous sized bedroom with large closets and hardwood floor. Large living area with dining area. Laundry on premises. Great location with convenient access to I-95 and Merritt Pkwy. Next to the elementary school and around the corner from the hospital. Very close to all public transportation and shopping. Quiet setting in Kingsley complex with a parklike atmosphere. Available Immediately.  The unit comes with one assigned parking spot (#47); there is a communal laundry room in building F which is in the center of the complex; the Postal Box are also located in the center of the complex. All applicants are required to do a RentSpree application, credit check, and provide proof of funds.",
